{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.TFromTraceCyclicity","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.TFromTraceCyclicity","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.MarkovTrace"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.TFromTraceCyclicity.markovTrace_eq_timeReversal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.TFromTraceCyclicity.markovTrace_eq_timeReversal","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/TFromTraceCyclicity.lean#L112-L117","doc":"Conditional: the same invariance stated in the other direction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.TFromTraceCyclicity.markovTrace_timeReversal_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.TFromTraceCyclicity.markovTrace_timeReversal_eq","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/TFromTraceCyclicity.lean#L104-L110","doc":"Conditional consequence: assuming the conjecture, a word and its time\nreversal are Markov-trace indistinguishable. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.TFromTraceCyclicity.trace_reversal_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.TFromTraceCyclicity.trace_reversal_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/TFromTraceCyclicity.lean#L97-L97","doc":"**The conjecture**: the Markov trace of a braid word equals that of\nits time reversal, for every representation and every word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.TFromTraceCyclicity.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.TFromTraceCyclicity.mk","kind":"ctor","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/TFromTraceCyclicity.lean#L94-L94","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.TFromTraceCyclicity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.TFromTraceCyclicity","kind":"class","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/TFromTraceCyclicity.lean#L86-L100","doc":"**Time-reversal closure (conjecture).**\n\nThe one unproved input: the Markov trace does not see word reversal.\n\nAxiomatised as a class per AGENTS.md §3b — providing an instance\nasserts the conjecture. The field is parameter-quantified over every\nrepresentation and every braid word, i.e. it is stated in the shape of\nthe claim rather than as an opaque `Prop`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:t-from-trace-cyclicity","label":"conj:t-from-trace-cyclicity","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/t-from-trace-cyclicity.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.timeReversal_append","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.timeReversal_append","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/TFromTraceCyclicity.lean#L81-L84","doc":"`T` reverses concatenation: `(v ++ w)^T = w^T ++ v^T`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.timeReversal_perm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.timeReversal_perm","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/TFromTraceCyclicity.lean#L73-L79","doc":"**`T` preserves generator indices and signs**: the reversed word is a\npermutation of the original as a multiset of `(generator, sign)` pairs.\nThis is the precise sense in which `T` \"acts purely on the ordering of\ncrossings\" and \"preserves Hecke generator signs\". ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.timeReversal_crossings","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.timeReversal_crossings","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/TFromTraceCyclicity.lean#L68-L71","doc":"**`T` preserves the crossing count** (it only reorders crossings). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.timeReversal_involutive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.timeReversal_involutive","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/TFromTraceCyclicity.lean#L63-L66","doc":"**`T` is an involution**, `T² = id` — unconditional. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.timeReversal_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.timeReversal_nil","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/TFromTraceCyclicity.lean#L60-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.timeReversal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.timeReversal","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/TFromTraceCyclicity.lean#L55-L58","doc":"**Time reversal** on braid words: reverse the order of the crossings,\nkeeping each generator index and each sign. ","signatureChunk":0}]}